  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support children with facial differences in Taiwan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sunshine Social Welfare Foundation will support 300 children with facial difference and their families annually, by addressing their medical, financial, psychosocial and educational concerns through medical information, financial aid for medical interventions not covered by the national health insurance, emotional support and psychological counseling, school re-entry programs and educational programs. Services will be provided throughout Taiwan by our six regional service centers.</narrative>
  </description>
